<title>USA: CBOE moves back Fresenius options date.</title>
<headline>CBOE moves back Fresenius options date.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Chicago Board Options Exchange said on Wednesday it pushed back the listing of Fresenius Medical Care AG options to September 30 from September 27.</p>
<p>The exchange said it kept the option's other specifications the same, with initial expiration months of October, November, February and May and opening strikes of 20, 22-1/2 and 25.</p>
<p>Fresenius Medical Care AG is a combination of Fresenius AG's worldwide kidney dialysis business and National Medical Care Inc, formerly a unit of W.R. Grace &amp; Co. --Derivatives desk, 312/408-8750/E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com</p>
